  button: BON VOYAGE
  riddle: A map, two boarding passes, two luggage tags, sunglasses and a camera.
    Time to leave.
  hint: Tip the pile a long way forward. The rolled map is the body, the tickets
    are wings and the tags are the tail.
  complete: 'BON VOYAGE

    Window seat, please.'
